[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/thorn-vine-grass.png" id="3_icon"]

; Thorned Vine. The id stays thorn_vine - saves, unlocks and the evolution ids all key on it; only
; the name the player reads changed. A vine that bursts from the ground beside the thickest pack and
; lashes across it (scripts/ThornVine.cs). BaseDamage is one cut; it cuts through 1 + 3 enemies, plus
; the spell's Pierce, before it snags, and poisons each.
;
; Level 3 lengthens the vine by 12 px (Effect 7, AreaSize) where the bolt it replaced gained
; projectile speed it no longer has. Everything else is what Player.EnsureRelevantLevelUps gives any
; spell with these tags: +1 damage a level, a cooldown step on even levels, Pierce +1 at 4 and
; poison +1 a tick at 5.

